WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.951
The scoring device (left) fails? Continue on another one (right).

2
00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:09.001
You need the game PIN ("Match" → "Show PINs") and the game number (top).

3
00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:16.726
On the other device: "Restore match", then the game number and the game PIN.

4
00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:23.776
"Search cloud backups", pick the match, check it, "Confirm restore".

5
00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:31.107
The right device scores now. The left one is told: "Scored on another device".

6
00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:33.491
To score on the first device again: "Take back scoring here".

7
00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:38.809
It loads the score from the server first. Compare it, then "Yes, take back scoring here".

8
00:00:38.859 --> 00:00:45.859
The left device scores again; the right one stops at its next action.
